1561 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Ability Scores\056 Your Constitution Score increases by 1\056\nCold Core\056 You have resistance to cold damage\056\nFrost Protection\056 Your connection to the harsh\054 frozen wilderness manifests as an innate ability to manifest life saving fire\056 You learn the Produce Flame cantrip\056 Starting at 10th level\054 you can also cast Flame Shield once per long rest without expending a spell slot\056 Wisdom is your spellcasting ability for these spells\056)
     /K [ 4 ]
     /P 1562 0 R
     /Pg 950 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

