1563 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The High Elves are the oldest elven lineage on Pliiara and the most abundant across the realm\056 Their presence spans almost every major region\054 including the dense jungles of Amobo\054 the grand cities of Highpeak\054 and the sun baked expanses of Duror\056 Because they are so ubiquitous\054 whenever a traveler or scholar refers simply to an elf without specifying a subrace\054 they are almost certainly speaking of a High Elf\056\n\nStanding an average of 5 feet tall and weighing just over 100 pounds\054 High Elves possess a light frame paired with a refined poise\056 Their personal style depends heavily on where they live\056 Those who roam the wilds lean toward vibrant garments anchored by green and gray cloaks designed to blend with forest foliage\056 Conversely\054 the vast numbers who prefer urban life\054 courtly politics\054 and settled civilization tend to wear opulent\054 highly tailored attire that projects a distinctly haughty aesthetic\056\n\nOwing to their extraordinary lifespans\054 High Elves are extraordinarily common in positions of authority\056 Kingdoms and governing bodies frequently seek them out to serve as head councilors and esteemed magistrates\054 valuing their ability to navigate complex political landscapes with centuries of experience\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 1564 0 R
     /Pg 950 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

