1572 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Sometimes called Gold Elves\054 Sun Elves are a distinct elven subrace drawn to scorching heat and arid deserts\056 They hold a core cosmological belief that the sun serves as the ultimate source of all magic on Pliiara\056 While they do not doubt Plii\047s existence or the divine story surrounding her\054 they contend that she placed the sun in the sky specifically to empower the world\047s magical forces\056 Consequently\054 Sun Elves feel nearest to their creator in the hottest environments\056 In these sun drenched lands\054 they devote much of their time to deep meditation\054 harnessing intense sunlight to rapidly regenerate their physical bodies\054 though doing so exacts a severe toll\056\n\nTheir relentless pursuit of spiritual enlightenment and ancient knowledge directly drives their desire to draw as close to Plii\047s divine warmth as possible\056 Standing an average of 5 feet tall with a slender frame\054 Sun Elves rival humans in height while remaining noticeably distinct in appearance\056 Living up to their golden moniker\054 they possess rich bronze or gold skin paired with hair of matching hues\056 A few rare individuals display shades of bright golden blonde or vibrant red\056 Their striking almond eyes are almost universally vivid green or brilliant yellow\054 echoing the sunlit domains they inhabit\056)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 1573 0 R
     /Pg 1550 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

