1574 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Ability Scores\056 Your Constitution Score increases by 1\056\nElf Weapon Training\056 You have proficiency with the longsword\054 shortsword\054 shortbow\054 and longbow\056\nAcclimated\056 You have resistance to fire damage\056\nSolar Recharge\056 Once per day while in direct sunlight\054 you can meditate for one hour to unlock the divine power granted by Plii\056 Upon completing this hour of meditation\054 you gain the full benefits of a long rest and cure all active diseases and poisons affecting you\056\nAfter using this feature\054 you cannot regain hit points from any source\054 including magical healing or potions\054 though you can still be stabilized if dying\056 Additionally\054 you cannot use your Trance feature until you complete a standard long rest\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 1575 0 R
     /Pg 1550 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

