1578 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The Wyld Elves of Pliiara are a nomadic people who rarely settle in one place until old age\056 Constantly moving\054 they form tight bands of three to five members who travel as family units to explore the world\056 On rare occasions\054 these small groups journey alongside wandering bands of Plains Orcs\056 It is extremely uncommon to see a Wyld Elf out on their own or as a part of an adventuring party\056\n\nWyld Elves share a close ancestral connection with High Elves\054 making infants of both subraces almost indistinguishable at birth\056 However\054 physical differences emerge as they grow\056 Wyld Elves reach a height of only three to four feet and develop unusually large ears\054 which many use as an informal gauge of their ancestral purity\056 Some individuals are born with sleek\054 glistening wings on their backs\054 while others manifest magical gifts to assist their travels\056\n\nWhile Wyld Elves avoid sprawling cities\054 they occasionally visit small villages and remote towns to trade for essential supplies\056 Their style during these visits varies greatly\056 Some favor dark clothing to stay unnoticed\054 whereas others wear vibrant colors and entertain locals with lively performances\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 1579 0 R
     /Pg 1550 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

