  >>
endobj

1580 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Ability Scores\056 Your Charisma Score increases by 1\056\nWyld Elf Weapon Training\056 You have proficiency with the shortbow\054 longbow\054 net\054 and whip\056\nWyld Elf Diversity\056 Your unique heritage manifests either as physical wings or as an innate connection to nature magic\056 Choose one of the following options\072\nFey Wings\072 Silvery\054 pale wings emerge from your back\056 You gain a flying speed equal to your walking speed while you are not wearing heavy armor\056\nWild Magic\072 You learn two cantrips of your choice from the Druid spell list\056 You also learn one 1st\055level spell from the Druid spell list\054 which you can cast a number of times equal to your Intelligence modifier per long rest\056 When you reach 10th level\054 you learn one additional 1st\055level spell from the Druid spell list\056 Intelligence is your spellcasting ability for these spells\056)
     /K [ 6 ]
     /P 1581 0 R
     /Pg 1550 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

